    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d400">

                <pb facs="1452" n="1294" xml:id="pg1294"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Meyer to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-05-31"><hi rendition="#italic">May 31,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs informs me that Kassim Didjavadgé and Ali Porkhall
                    Oghly have been arrested under the charge of having assassinated Stuart and that
                    the former has already admitted his participation in the crime. He adds that it
                    appears from the communication of His Majesty’s lieutenant in the Caucasus that
                    the investigation is being actively followed up and that he expects to advise me
                    as soon as possible of its final result.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Meyer.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
